# The build context of deploy/*.Dockerfile is the repository root: send only what an image copies. Never the
# data directory (the corpus, indexes, search records and the takedown log with requesters' details), never
# .env files (credentials), never local builds or node_modules.
*
!deploy/web-build-gate.sh
!deploy/Caddyfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/LICENSE
!backend/src/
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!frontend/
frontend/node_modules
frontend/.next
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/data
**/takedowns
frontend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__
